WEBVTT

00:05:56.644 --> 00:06:02.108
and the fact that we humans
on this one little planet Earth

00:06:02.108 --> 00:06:05.694
can craft an instrument
that has the capability

00:06:05.694 --> 00:06:10.282
to let us see that,
13.5 billion years ago,

00:06:10.282 --> 00:06:11.742
or whatever it ends up being,

00:06:11.742 --> 00:06:13.953
is really phenomenal.

00:06:13.994 --> 00:06:15.246
HH: Yeah.

00:06:16.163 --> 00:06:19.625
I view it as an example
of what humanity can do

00:06:19.667 --> 00:06:22.378
when we work for the greater good,

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:26.549
when we work as teams
and we have a goal.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:31.554
This project required
thousands of people in multiple countries,